sequenceDiagram
    participant PaC as Pipelines-as-Code
    participant Init as rhoai-init Task
    participant Clone as git-clone-oci-ta
    participant Prefetch as prefetch-operand-<br/>manifests-oci-ta
    participant Build as buildah-oci-ta
    participant Scans as Security Scans<br/>(Clair, ClamAV,<br/>Snyk, SAST)
    participant Eval as evaluate-scan-results
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Quay as Quay.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Slack as Slack Webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over PaC,Slack: Flow 1: Container Build Pipeline

    PaC->>Init: Trigger PipelineRun
    Init->>Init: Compute CPE ID<br/>(RHEL 8 if < 2.20, RHEL 9 if >= 2.20)
    Init->>Init: Parse image output<br/>(registry/namespace/name/tag)
    Init-->>PaC: Pipeline results (cpe, image parts, Slack config)

    PaC->>Clone: Clone source repo
    Clone->>GitHub: HTTPS/443 Git credentials
    GitHub-->>Clone: Source code

    PaC->>Prefetch: Prefetch operand manifests
    Prefetch->>GitHub: Clone RHOAI-Konflux-Automation<br/>HTTPS/443
    Prefetch->>GitHub: Clone ODH-Build-Config<br/>HTTPS/443
    Prefetch->>Prefetch: Run operator-processor
    Prefetch->>GitHub: Sparse-clone component manifests
    Prefetch->>Quay: Push trusted artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 Registry auth

    PaC->>Build: Build container image
    Build->>Quay: Push built image<br/>HTTPS/443 Registry auth

    PaC->>Scans: Run security scans
    Scans->>Scans: Clair, ClamAV, Snyk,<br/>SAST shell/unicode checks

    PaC->>Eval: Evaluate scan results
    Eval->>Eval: Aggregate TEST_OUTPUT<br/>Categorize: gating vs advisory
    Eval-->>PaC: Report (always pass, report-only mode)

    alt Build Failure
        PaC->>Slack: POST failure notification<br/>HTTPS/443 Webhook secret
    end

    Note over PaC,Slack: Flow 2: Cross-Repository Build Triggering

    PaC->>GitHub: trigger-operator-build<br/>POST commit comment /test<br/>Bearer token
    GitHub-->>PaC: Operator build triggered

    PaC->>GitHub: trigger-bundle-build<br/>POST workflow dispatch<br/>Bearer token
    GitHub-->>PaC: Bundle build dispatched

    Note over PaC,Slack: Flow 3: Group Testing Orchestration

    PaC->>GitHub: trigger-group-testing<br/>GET check runs on PR<br/>Bearer token
    GitHub-->>PaC: All checks complete

    PaC->>GitHub: POST /group-test comment<br/>Bearer token

    PaC->>Quay: generate-snapshot<br/>GET tag/manifest queries
    Quay-->>PaC: Image digests + git provenance

    PaC->>Quay: GET config blob<br/>(git.url, git.commit labels)
    Quay-->>PaC: Component snapshot JSON
